#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1350
msgid "Sometimes, one side can achieve a winning position without a mistake"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1352
msgid "by their opponent that is above the error threshold."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1354
msgid "So an annotation would not normally be added."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1357
msgid ""
"e.g.  Given a winning threshold of 1.5 pawns and a current postion value"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1359
msgid "of 1.4 in White's favour and Black plays a move with a value of 0.3"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1361
msgid ""
"If the error threshold for moves is set at 0.6, no annotation would be added,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1363
msgid ""
"even if there was a better move for Black available, say -0.2 for example."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1366
msgid ""
"If < Identify winning position > is checked, an annotation is added in this "
"case."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1369
msgid ""
"However, because the margins of victory are so tight here,  this feature can "
"produce"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1371
msgid ""
"contradictory results in the annotations, especially at time settings that "
"do not allow"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1373
msgid "for deep enough searchs of the position. (Roughly 16 ply)"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1376
msgid "This problem is largely solved by allowing more time for the analysis,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1378
msgid "and/or by adjusting the < Error margin > setting upwards."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1381
msgid "On my computer, a Time per move setting of 3 seconds combined"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1383
msgid "with an error margin of 10 (0.1 pawns) is ok."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1385
msgid "At 5 seconds per move, an error margin of 7 (0.07 pawns) is ok."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1387
msgid "At 10 seconds per move, an error margin of 5 (0.05 pawns) is ok."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1389
msgid "At 15 seconds per move, an error margin of 3 (0.03) is ok."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:1391
msgid "At 20 seconds per move and above, no error margin is needed."
msgstr ""

