#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2343
msgid "Unfortunately there is a small, harmless, very rare bug"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2345
msgid "that emerges during the automatic analysis of games."
