#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2348
msgid ""
"Very occasionally, the program will insert a comment for a sub-variation"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2350
msgid "without having added the sub-variation for which it was intended."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2352
msgid ""
"So the sub-var comment ends up being incongruously placed in the main line."
