#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2355
msgid "Other than being a bit confusing and looking rather silly,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2357
msgid "it does not seem to cause any serious problems."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2359
msgid "It quite easy to identify and manually correct the error in"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2361
msgid "the game annotations, once automatic game analysis has finished."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2364
msgid "For users who find this problem is more frequent on their computer"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2366
msgid "during auto-analysis, I have implemented a bug fix."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2368
msgid "This solution behaves rather strangely,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2370
msgid "so I have offered the following options for usage :-"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2373
msgid ""
"Use bug fix :  Check this box to switch on bug fixing for the addition of "
"sub-vars."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2376
msgid "Check list change :  Check this box if the list box position changes"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2378
msgid "after a sub-variation is added."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2380
msgid "(This was my expectation, but on my computer the opposite is the case.)"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2383
msgid "By default, < Bug fix > and < Check list change > are switched off."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2386
msgid ""
"If there are no errors when sub - var comments are added, or you are not"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2388
msgid ""
"troubled if a few errors arise, I suggest leaving these options switched off."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2391
msgid "However, if more errors arise, you may want to switch < Bug fix > on."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2393
msgid "In this case, you then have to decide how to set < Check list change >"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2396
msgid "So if you have set the program to add sub-variation comments"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\AnalyseGameDialog.cpp:2398
msgid ""
