#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:692
msgid ""
"This dialog box allow you to select the user-defined background settings."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:695
msgid ""
"To cover the screen for a user-defined background, I have used a large "
"triangle,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:697
msgid "because this method is makes the coding much easier."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:699
msgid ""
"The following options allow you to change the properties of the triangle"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:701
msgid "and thus the appearence of the main window background."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:704
msgid ""
"Use colour gradient  -  Check this button to use a colour gradient for the "
"triangle"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:706
msgid "that is used for the main window background."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:709
msgid "Background triangle vertex colours -"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:712
msgid "Click on the colour box next to the triangle vertex number"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:714
msgid "to activate the colour selection dialog box for the vertex."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:717
msgid "To restore the standard colour for a triangle vertex,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:719 C:\temp11\ColoursDialog.cpp:784
#: C:\temp11\ColoursDialog3d.cpp:443 C:\temp11\ColoursDialog3d.cpp:987
#: C:\temp11\HighlightDialog.cpp:816
msgid "click on the < Default > button next to the colour."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:722
msgid "Change vertex colours with board flip  -"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:725
msgid ""
"These options allow you to specify how the vertex colours are changed after"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:727
msgid ""
"a board flip.  This only applies if < Flip background with board > is "
"checked."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:730
msgid "Swap  -  swaps the colour of the bottom vertex with the two top ones."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:732
msgid "with the default settings, this simply reverses the colour gradient."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:735
msgid "Rotate up  -  this will rotate the colour vertices upwards."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:737
msgid ""
"i.e.  vertex 2 colour will be set to vertex 1 colour, v3 to v2 and v1 to v3"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:740
msgid "Rotate up  -  this will rotate the colour vertices downwards."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:742
msgid ""
"i.e.  vertex 1 colour will be set to vertex 2 colour, v2 to v3 and v3 to v1"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:745
msgid "Use image for background  -  Check this button to use a bitmap image"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:747
msgid "for the main window background."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:750
msgid "Select image file  -  Select the image file that you want to use."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:753
msgid "You may select  *.png  *.jpg  *.bmp  *.dds  *.dib  and  *.tga  files."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:755
msgid ""
"For more details on using bitmap image files click on the < Image files > "
"button"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:758
msgid ""
"Triangle size  -  input the size for the window background colour triangle."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:761
msgid "A smaller size gives better definition, but if you make it too small,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:763
msgid "it will not fully cover the screen."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:766
msgid "Flip background with board  -  Check to flip the main window background"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:768
msgid "in harmony with a board flip."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:771
msgid "To restore the default values for all screen elements,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:773 C:\temp11\ColoursDialog.cpp:789
#: C:\temp11\ColoursDialog3d.cpp:448 C:\temp11\ColoursDialog3d.cpp:992
#: C:\temp11\CycloneDialog.cpp:624
msgid "click on the Defaults button at the bottom of the screen."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:788
msgid "Like the board bitmaps and the sound effects,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:790
msgid "you can add files to use for the main window background in 3d"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:793
msgid "You may use the following file types for a background bitmap image."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:798
msgid ""
"Unlike the board bitmap files, although there are no rigid size restrictions,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:800
msgid "I strongly advise you to make them square and the size a power of 2,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:802
msgid ""
"e.g.  512 * 512, 1024 * 1024 etc.  because then they load much more quickly."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:805
msgid ""
"In terms of definition quality, there does not seem to be much difference"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:807
msgid "between the formats when used in this program."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:809
msgid "I have provided .png and .jpg versions of the Travertine009 file"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:811
msgid "from Ambientcg.com so that you can compare them if you wish to."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:813
msgid "I did try a *.png version of this file, 2048 pixels square,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:815
msgid ""
"and the definition was marginally better, but the file size is much larger,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:817
msgid ""
"5.2mb for 2048 pixels square compared with 1.3mb for 1024 pixels square."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:819
msgid "Ambientcg.com has some really high definition versions of their files,"
