#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:821
msgid "if you want to try them."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\BackgroundDialog3d.cpp:824
msgid "There are many free sources for bitmap image files, if you want"
msgstr ""

