#: C:\temp11\EngineDialog.cpp:2243
msgid "With this version of the program, I have increased the storage length"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineDialog.cpp:2245
msgid ""
"for engine file names (with path) in *.epm files from 80 to 256 characters,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineDialog.cpp:2247
