msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineDialog.cpp:2266
msgid "If you disregard this guideline, it usually won't cause the program"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineDialog.cpp:2268
msgid "to crash, but the option will not work."
msgstr ""

