#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1408
msgid ""
"This dialog box allows the user to select the engine parameters to load."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1410
msgid "For the purpose of this help screen, the terms < engine parameters >"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1412
msgid "and < engine options > are both used and mean the same thing."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1415
msgid ""
"The options can be selected in the same way as when using Windows explorer."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1417
msgid "i.e.  Shift + Left click to select a contiguous block of options,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1419
msgid "or Ctrl + Left click to select non-contiguous options."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1422
msgid "When you have finished selecting options, click on < Add options.. >"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1424
msgid "to add them to the custom parameter list."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1427
msgid "By default, the selected options will be added to the existing ones."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1429
msgid "Check < Overwrite current options > if you want the selected options"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1431
msgid "to overwrite the existing custom parameters."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1434
msgid "When an engine option is loaded, the value is set to the default."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1436
msgid "So if you want to change this, you must manually edit the value"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1438
msgid "in the appropriate custom parameter box."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1440
msgid ""
"The default value given for an option is an indication of permissible values."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1442
msgid "Some options can be set to true or false,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1444
msgid "some to a number between the min and max values,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1446
msgid "some to one of several Var options and some to a file name."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1448
msgid "When entering a value, be careful not to add any leading spaces,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1450
msgid "because then the option will not work."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1453
msgid "If you want to use more than the eight custom parameters allowed for"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1455
msgid "in the engine dialog box, check the < Edit parameters > box."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1457
msgid "Then column one of the list will change from the option number"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1459
msgid "to a value that you can then edit."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1461
msgid "Initially, these values are set to the default."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1463
msgid "When you have finished editing click < Ok >"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1465
msgid ""
"The engine parameter list dialog box will close, the values will be saved"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1467
msgid "in memory and used with the engine during the current session."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1469
msgid "If you want to store the values permanenetly to a file,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1471
msgid "then click on the small"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1471
msgid "box next to < Save parameters >"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1473
msgid "You can then save the parameters in a < .epf > file"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1475
msgid "which can be subsequently loaded with the < Load parameters > option."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1477
msgid "These < .epf > files for storing engine parameters are not the same"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1479
msgid "as the < .epm > files for storing the options in the engine dialog box,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1481
msgid "and are not inter changeable."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1484
msgid "For a detailed description of some of the UCI options available,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1486
msgid "click on the < UCI options > button."
msgstr ""

