#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1591
msgid "Here is a description of some UCI engine parameters."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1593
msgid "Most of these are used for the Stockfish engine but other engines"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1595
msgid "will have many of these parameters, or something similar."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1598
msgid "These descriptions are based on the UCI protocol standard written by"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1600
msgid "Rudolf Huber and Stefan-Meyer Kahlen."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1603
msgid "Threads  -  The number of CPU threads used for searching a position."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1605
msgid ""
"For best performance, set this equal to the number of CPU cores available."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1608
msgid ""
"Hash  -  The size of the hash table in MB.  It is recommended to set Hash"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1610
msgid "after setting Threads."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1613
msgid "Clear Hash  -  Clears the hash table."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1616
msgid ""
"Ponder  -  Let the engine ponder its next move while the opponent is "
"thinking."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1619
msgid ""
"MultiPV  -  Output the N best lines(principal variations, PVs) when "
"searching."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1621
msgid "Leave at 1 for the best performance."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1624
msgid ""
"Use NNUE  -  Toggle between the NNUE and classical evaluation functions."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1626
msgid ""
"If set to true, the network parameters must be available to load from the "
"file"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1628
msgid ""
"(see also EvalFile), if they are not embedded in the binary (*.exe engine "
"file)"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1631
msgid "EvalFile  -  The name of the file of the NNUE evaluation parameters."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1633
msgid "Depending on the GUI, the filename might have to include the full path"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1635
msgid "to the folder / directory that contains the file."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1637
msgid "Other locations, such as the directory that contains the binary"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1639
msgid "and the working directory, are also searched."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1641
msgid "For Stockfish versions 12 and later, which have neural net capability,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1643
msgid "the default neural net is usually embedded in the *.exe file."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1646
msgid ""
"UCI_ShowWDL  -  If enabled, show approximate WDL statistics as part of the"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1648
msgid "engine output.  These WDL numbers model expected game outcomes for a"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1650
msgid "given evaluation and game ply for engine self - play"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1652
msgid "at 60 seconds + 0.6 seconds per game."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1655
msgid ""
"UCI_LimitStrength  -  Enable weaker play aiming for an Elo rating as set by "
"UCI_Elo."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1657
msgid "This option overrides < Skill Level >"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1660
msgid ""
"UCI_Elo type  -  If enabled by UCI_LimitStrength, aim for an engine strength"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1662
msgid ""
"of the given Elo.  This Elo rating has been calibrated at a time control of"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1664
msgid "60 seconds per game + 0.6seconds per move"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1667
msgid ""
"Skill Level  -  Lower the Skill Level in order to make the engine play "
"weaker,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1669
msgid ""
"as with UCI_LimitStrength.  Internally, MultiPV is enabled, and with a "
"certain"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1671
msgid "probability depending on the Skill Level, a weaker move will be played."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1674
msgid ""
"SyzygyPath  -  Path to the folders / directories storing the Syzygy "
"tablebase files."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1676
msgid "Multiple directories are to be separated by a semi-colon < ; >"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1678
msgid "Do not use spaces around the semi-colon.  Here is an example -"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1683
msgid ""
"SyzygyProbeDepth  -  Minimum remaining depth for which a position is probed."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1685
msgid ""
"Set this option to a higher value to probe less aggressively if you "
"experience"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1687
msgid "too much slowdown(in terms of nps) due to tablebase probing."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1690
msgid ""
"Syzygy50MoveRule  -  Disable to let fifty-move rule draws detected by Syzygy"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1692
msgid "tablebase probes count as wins or losses."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1695
msgid ""
"SyzygyProbeLimit  -  Limit Syzygy tablebase probing to positions with at most"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1697
msgid "this many pieces left(including kings and pawns)."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1700
msgid "Move Overhead  -  Assume a time delay of x milli-seconds due to network"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1702
msgid "and GUI overheads."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1704
msgid ""
"Specifying a value larger than the default is needed to avoid time losses"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1706
msgid ""
"or near instantaneous moves, in particular for time controls without "
"increment"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1708
msgid ""
"(e.g.sudden death).  The default is suitable for engine - engine matches "
"played"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1710
msgid ""
"locally on dedicated hardware, while it needs to be increased on a loaded "
"system,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1712
msgid "when playing over a network, or when using certain GUIs"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1715
msgid ""
"Slow Mover  -  Lower values will make the engine take less time in games,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1717
msgid "higher values will make it think longer."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1720
msgid ""
"Nodestime  -  Tells the engine to use nodes searched instead of wall time"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1722
msgid "to account for elapsed time.  This is useful for engine testing."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1724
msgid ""
"When this option is set, the engine is only limited by the total amount of "
"nodes"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1726
msgid "searched per game.  This limit is calculated once per game."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1728
msgid ""
"The initial time control values in milliseconds (time and increment per move)"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1730
msgid ""
"are used as input values to calculate the total number of nodes per game."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1732
msgid "The increment per move inc is used as if it was just one move per game."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1734
msgid "The formula is totalnodes = (time + inc * 1) * nodestime."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1736
msgid "Suppose you specified nodestime = 600, and the time control per game is"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1738
msgid "300 seconds plus 3 seconds increment per move (300s + 3s),"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1740
msgid "or 300000 milliseconds plus 3000 milliseconds increment per move."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1742
msgid "In that case, the maximum total number of nodes searched per game"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1744
msgid "by the engine is totalnodes = (300000 + 3000 * 1) * 600 = 181800000"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1746
msgid "(one hundred eighty one million, eight hundred thousand) nodes,"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1748
msgid "regardless of how much wall time it will actually take."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1751
msgid ""
"Debug Log File  -  Write all communication to and from the engine into a "
"text file."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\EngineOptionDialog.cpp:1754
msgid ""
