msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\SelectSetDialog3d.cpp:716
msgid "I usually select < Shrink wrap > < Fit > < Bitmap fit >"
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\SelectSetDialog3d.cpp:718
msgid ""
"and then select a square 256 pixel bitmap, like the ones used in Nimzo_3d."
msgstr ""

#: C:\temp11\SelectSetDialog3d.cpp:720
msgid "Then select < Export > and choose the DirectX converter from the list."
